{"id": "3035217", "name": "מד\"ר סדר שני, מציאת ערך פרמטר כך ששתי פונקציות אינן פתרונות בתל", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p></p><p>נתונה מד\"ר</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(y''+p(x)y'+q(x)y=0\\)</p><p>כאשר \\(p(x),q(x)\\) פונקציות רציפות על כל הישר. נתון כי&nbsp;</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(y_1(x)={{CT:0}}\\)</p><p>פתרון למד\"ר. תהא&nbsp;</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(y_2(x)={{CT:1}}\\)</p><p style=\"direction: rtl;\">כאשר \\(d\\) פרמטר. מצאו ערך לפרמטר \\(d\\) כך ש \\(y_2(x)\\) <strong>אינה </strong>יכולה להיות פתרון למד\"ר. התבוננו בנקודה \\({{CT:2}}\\)</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(d=\\)[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "dd", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "c", "dd", "slope", "x0", "y1", "y2"], "nvariants": 50}